Tech stack: .NET 8 Minimal API + Blazor Server (single solution), EF Core 8 + SQL Server LocalDB,
raw DbCommand for LLM SQL in SqlExecutionService, EPAM DIAL GPT-4o, NSubstitute + xUnit + FluentAssertions,
GitHub Actions CI. Scoped services: IDialClient, ITextToSqlService, ISqlExecutionService,
IResultInterpreterService, IConversationService. LLM: temp 0 (SQL), temp 0.3 (interpretation),
CANNOT_ANSWER sentinel, 10-exchange history cap.
